# CODEOWNERS
#
# Path-scoped reviewer assignments. GitHub will auto-tag a matching
# reviewer on every PR that touches one of the lines below; if no
# narrower rule matches, the * @shipking-ai default applies.
#
# Pattern format is the same as .gitignore. Last-match wins, so
# more-specific paths MUST come AFTER less-specific ones below.

# ── Default reviewer for everything in the repo ──
* @shipking-ai

# ── Schema migrations: misapplied migration = production data loss ──
/supabase/migrations/ @shipking-ai

# ── Release / mobile build pipelines — they gate what ships ──
/.github/workflows/release*.yml @shipking-ai
/.github/workflows/mobile-*.yml @shipking-ai

# ── Native stacks are archived (web-only); re-add owners if restored ──
